{"4506620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Well Devil", "steam_appid": 4506620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/4bb48bd944552ae7782a8d5d131d148a.avif?t=1784804087\" alt=\"Falling and Failing\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras_big/4bb48bd944552ae7782a8d5d131d148a.webp?t=1784804087 width=1560 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/02e854f747f86b05d1249bff9745ce51.poster.avif?t=1784804087\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/02e854f747f86b05d1249bff9745ce51.webm?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/02e854f747f86b05d1249bff9745ce51.mp4?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Black Well Devil</strong> you control <i>Luxor</i>, the former ruler of Hell, who, with the help of <i>Horace the giant Hand</i> tries to escape the Black Well by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick</strong> Luxor into the air, to reach higher and higher points! But watch out - If you miss your jump and <strong>fall </strong>down, you'll need<strong> to climb up again</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After ascending through countless rooms and dodging perilous traps you'll also meet certain denizens, who try to do everything in their power to stop your quest. You'll have to <strong>defeat them</strong> the only way you can: <strong>by jumping on their head!</strong> If they <i>have</i> a head...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/248a74c201b2af648669b0e1c47591a6.poster.avif?t=1784804087\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/248a74c201b2af648669b0e1c47591a6.webm?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/248a74c201b2af648669b0e1c47591a6.mp4?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/264130f7eb52e58e06178949d2eaebcf.avif?t=1784804087\" alt=\"Features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras_big/264130f7eb52e58e06178949d2eaebcf.webp?t=1784804087 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vertical World</strong> - Ascend to the top of the fully vertical and interconnected Black Well, but be careful! Any mistake could lead to a long fall backwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult to Master</strong> - Learn unique controls, flick yourself to the top using (mostly) just your mouse or a controller's analog stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALL Unique Challenges</strong> - Every single room is hand-drawn from scratch, all filled with unique challenges to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Art Style</strong> - Colorful and unusual creatures and environments, inspired by a mix of Art Deco, vintage comic books and hellish landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Multitude of Foes</strong> - Unique Bosses who ramp up in difficulty the higher you reach!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pogo Based Combat</strong> - Swiftly maneuver yourself in the air to repeatedly deal damage, dodge attacks and bounce off of your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Backdoors</strong> - The way up is not the only way. Who knows what else is the Black Well hiding?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helping out Each Other</strong> - Accept challenges and quests from NPCs for unique rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/fc8dbc5e24d457e6f406c396ef27ee3a.poster.avif?t=1784804087\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/fc8dbc5e24d457e6f406c396ef27ee3a.webm?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/fc8dbc5e24d457e6f406c396ef27ee3a.mp4?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/3e059515c45ffcad00601d9282589bf2.avif?t=1784804087\" alt=\"Friend or Fiend?\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras_big/3e059515c45ffcad00601d9282589bf2.webp?t=1784804087 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not easy being overthrown and locked into prison for hundreds of years. One might understandably develop trust issues. And rightly so - some of the strange denizens of the Black Well will try their damnedest to stop you, but you might also encounter a helping hand or two. Does <i>Kacperl</i> the madman, <i>Toto</i> the songstress or the <i>Sin Collector</i> really want to help you? Why is the one-eyed Constable always following you around? Who are the Bilesingers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While trying (and failing) to ascend to the top, you'll have the opportunity to uncover increasingly darker secrets and the true nature of the Black Well.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/4bb48bd944552ae7782a8d5d131d148a.avif?t=1784804087\" alt=\"Falling and Failing\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras_big/4bb48bd944552ae7782a8d5d131d148a.webp?t=1784804087 width=1560 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/02e854f747f86b05d1249bff9745ce51.poster.avif?t=1784804087\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/02e854f747f86b05d1249bff9745ce51.webm?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/02e854f747f86b05d1249bff9745ce51.mp4?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Black Well Devil</strong> you control <i>Luxor</i>, the former ruler of Hell, who, with the help of <i>Horace the giant Hand</i> tries to escape the Black Well by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick</strong> Luxor into the air, to reach higher and higher points! But watch out - If you miss your jump and <strong>fall </strong>down, you'll need<strong> to climb up again</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After ascending through countless rooms and dodging perilous traps you'll also meet certain denizens, who try to do everything in their power to stop your quest. You'll have to <strong>defeat them</strong> the only way you can: <strong>by jumping on their head!</strong> If they <i>have</i> a head...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/248a74c201b2af648669b0e1c47591a6.poster.avif?t=1784804087\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/248a74c201b2af648669b0e1c47591a6.webm?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/248a74c201b2af648669b0e1c47591a6.mp4?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/264130f7eb52e58e06178949d2eaebcf.avif?t=1784804087\" alt=\"Features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras_big/264130f7eb52e58e06178949d2eaebcf.webp?t=1784804087 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vertical World</strong> - Ascend to the top of the fully vertical and interconnected Black Well, but be careful! Any mistake could lead to a long fall backwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult to Master</strong> - Learn unique controls, flick yourself to the top using (mostly) just your mouse or a controller's analog stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALL Unique Challenges</strong> - Every single room is hand-drawn from scratch, all filled with unique challenges to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Art Style</strong> - Colorful and unusual creatures and environments, inspired by a mix of Art Deco, vintage comic books and hellish landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Multitude of Foes</strong> - Unique Bosses who ramp up in difficulty the higher you reach!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pogo Based Combat</strong> - Swiftly maneuver yourself in the air to repeatedly deal damage, dodge attacks and bounce off of your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Backdoors</strong> - The way up is not the only way. Who knows what else is the Black Well hiding?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helping out Each Other</strong> - Accept challenges and quests from NPCs for unique rewards!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/fc8dbc5e24d457e6f406c396ef27ee3a.poster.avif?t=1784804087\" width=1170 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/fc8dbc5e24d457e6f406c396ef27ee3a.webm?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/fc8dbc5e24d457e6f406c396ef27ee3a.mp4?t=1784804087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras/3e059515c45ffcad00601d9282589bf2.avif?t=1784804087\" alt=\"Friend or Fiend?\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/extras_big/3e059515c45ffcad00601d9282589bf2.webp?t=1784804087 width=1560 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not easy being overthrown and locked into prison for hundreds of years. One might understandably develop trust issues. And rightly so - some of the strange denizens of the Black Well will try their damnedest to stop you, but you might also encounter a helping hand or two. Does <i>Kacperl</i> the madman, <i>Toto</i> the songstress or the <i>Sin Collector</i> really want to help you? Why is the one-eyed Constable always following you around? Who are the Bilesingers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While trying (and failing) to ascend to the top, you'll have the opportunity to uncover increasingly darker secrets and the true nature of the Black Well.</p>", "short_description": "Ascend from the depths of hell in Black Well Devil, the stylish high-stakes platformer. Flick yourself into the air to reach higher heights, fall again and again, fight challenging bosses, and mayhaps fall in love.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/a6b7243bc34e683ea939bf47b4f8973bdeb2912e/header.jpg?t=1784804087", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/7901c20d7ad786cd4933aa3355bd77a5505c4415/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784804087", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506620/7901c20d7ad786cd4933aa3355bd77a5505c4415/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784804087", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Save Sloth Studios"], "publishers": ["Save Sloth Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"